+ *   1. "my team member keeps showing up out of uniform, wearing a hoodie, what do I do?" ended "… I can prepare one of
+ *      the forms below." with no forms below it;
+ *   2. "can you make a CA for <C> for wearing a hoodie to work?" made a card with no Policy line;
+ *   3. "Do i need to copy and paste it?", with that card on screen, was told how to make a card.
